    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6b018908602bf7.28850810\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which contains a bug fix for players seeing fewer groups than intended in LFG.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><h2 id=\"hotfixes\" class=\"heading-size-2 first\"><b>Hotfixes</b></h2><hr><b>November 20, 2026</b><br><br><b>Classes</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Rogue</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Combat</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Blade Flurry will now correctly cause Shank’s damage to hit an additional target.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Warlock</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Demonology</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed a bug where the effects of the Demonic Aegis talent could be snapshotted into your Demon Armor or Demon Skin and then untalented to retain the effects. Demonic Aegis and Demon Skin are removed when your talents are unlearned.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Dungeons</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Players can now reset and enter each dungeon a maximum of 5 times per hour (was 10).</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Blackrock Spire</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">A rebel stone pillar should no longer trap unsuspecting adventurers.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul><b>Enemies and NPCs</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Orgrimmar - Mayhoa Skyhoof no longer has glowing eyes.</div></li></ul><b>Items</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Stormshroud Armor 3-piece bonus changed to a 3% chance (was 4%) on melee attack of restoring 18 energy (was 30).</div></li></ul><b>Professions</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Toron Rockhoof has repaired his forge and anvil in Summit of Eternity and they should now be usable for blacksmithing and smelting.</div></li></ul><b>Quests</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The Hinterlands - Witch Doctor Ti’ik now drops multiple copies of his head when killed by a group that have the quest “Witch Doctor Ti’ik.” It be da voodoo, mon.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Feralas - Fixed an issue where Perfect Yeti Hide could drop again while you’re already on the quest it starts, “Perfect Yeti Hide.”</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Tanaris - Gor’marok now respawns more quickly for the quest “The Dunemaul Compound.”</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Riverglades - Dunston Willis no longer runs partway through the quest “Dunston Checks Out.”</div></li></ul><b>User Interface</b><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Resolved an issue that caused some players to see fewer groups than intended when looking for a group.</div></li></ul><hr></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which contains a bug fix for players seeing fewer groups than intended in LFG. <br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"><b>Hotfixes</b></h2><br /><b>November 20, 2026</b><br /><br /><b>Classes</b><br /><br /><ul><li><b>Rogue</b><br /><br /> <b>Combat</b><br /><br /> Blade Flurry will now correctly cause Shank’s damage to hit an additional target.</li></ul><br /><br /> <b>Warlock</b><br /> <ul><li><b>Demonology</b><br /><br /> Fixed a bug where the effects of the Demonic Aegis talent could be snapshotted into your Demon Armor or Demon Skin and then untalented to retain the effects. Demonic Aegis and Demon Skin are removed when your talents are unlearned.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Dungeons</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Players can now reset and enter each dungeon a maximum of 5 times per hour (was 10).</li><li><b>Blackrock Spire</b><br /><br /> A rebel stone pillar should no longer trap unsuspecting adventurers.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Enemies and NPCs</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Orgrimmar - Mayhoa Skyhoof no longer has glowing eyes.</li></ul><br /><b>Items</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Stormshroud Armor 3-piece bonus changed to a 3% chance (was 4%) on melee attack of restoring 18 energy (was 30).</li></ul><br /><b>Professions</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Toron Rockhoof has repaired his forge and anvil in Summit of Eternity and they should now be usable for blacksmithing and smelting.</li></ul><br /><b>Quests</b><br /><br /><ul><li>The Hinterlands - Witch Doctor Ti’ik now drops multiple copies of his head when killed by a group that have the quest “Witch Doctor Ti’ik.” It be da voodoo, mon.</li><li>Feralas - Fixed an issue where Perfect Yeti Hide could drop again while you’re already on the quest it starts, “Perfect Yeti Hide.”</li><li>Tanaris - Gor’marok now respawns more quickly for the quest “The Dunemaul Compound.”</li><li>Riverglades - Dunston Willis no longer runs partway through the quest “Dunston Checks Out.”</li></ul><br /><b>User Interface</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Resolved an issue that caused some players to see fewer groups than intended when looking for a group.</li></ul></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56204-lfg-bug-fix-causes-players-to-see-more-groups-wow-forever-hotfixes-for-november.jpg",
