    "title": {
      "en": "[UPDATED] All Skyborne Now Get Discount for Mounts Regardless of Reputation in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "[ACTUALIZADO] Ahora todos los Skyborne obtienen descuentos en monturas independientemente de su reputación en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "[UPDATED] All Skyborne Now Get Discount for Mounts Regardless of Reputation in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "[ACTUALIZADO] Todos los Skyborne ahora disfrutan de un descuento en las monturas, independientemente de su reputación en WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6b01891d719856.49324158\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">All Skyborne now get a 10% discount on mounts in WoW: Forever, regardless of reputation. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">WoW: Forever Mount Guide</span></a></div><br><br><div class=\"markup-grid exclude-units\" data-align=\"centered\" style=\"--markup-gridColumnBasis: 800px;\"><div class=\"last\" style=\"border:2px solid red; padding:10px;\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><b>Article Update: Skyborne always gets a 10% discount now, regardless of reputation. The article has been updated.</b></div></div></div><br><br>With the release of WoW: Forever, players noticed that the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/skyborne-dont-have-reputation-discount-for-mounts-in-wow-forever-383873\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Skyborne don't get a 10% discount</a> with mount vendors. In yesterday's hotfixes, Blizzard mentioned this:<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue preventing the Skyborne from being able to receive the Honored reputation 10% gold discount on their Apprentice and Journeyman Riding skills sold by Genn Fairweather on Zephras Isle.</div></div>While this seems to imply that Skyborne will now get the reputation discount for being Honored, the discount now seems to be active for all Skyborne. A character that is Friendly with the Windshapers still has the 10% discount for both the Rare and Epic mount skills. This likely means that it now gives a discount to all Skyborne, regardless of their faction reputation!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309826.jpg\" id=\"1309826\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1309826.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Faction Discount Skyborne\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 5.77778 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>It's unknown if this is intended, but Skyborne can now enjoy a discounted mount!</div>\n            \n            <noscript>All Skyborne now get a 10% discount on mounts in WoW: Forever, regardless of reputation. <br /><br />WoW: Forever Mount Guide<br /><br /> <b>Article Update: Skyborne always gets a 10% discount now, regardless of reputation. The article has been updated.</b> <br /><br />With the release of WoW: Forever, players noticed that the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/skyborne-dont-have-reputation-discount-for-mounts-in-wow-forever-383873\">Skyborne don't get a 10% discount</a> with mount vendors. In yesterday's hotfixes, Blizzard mentioned this:<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Blizzard</h2><br />Fixed an issue preventing the Skyborne from being able to receive the Honored reputation 10% gold discount on their Apprentice and Journeyman Riding skills sold by Genn Fairweather on Zephras Isle.</div></div><br /><br />While this seems to imply that Skyborne will now get the reputation discount for being Honored, the discount now seems to be active for all Skyborne. A character that is Friendly with the Windshapers still has the 10% discount for both the Rare and Epic mount skills. This likely means that it now gives a discount to all Skyborne, regardless of their faction reputation!<br /><br />It's unknown if this is intended, but Skyborne can now enjoy a discounted mount!</noscript>            \n        ",
